# Action catalogue: named CLIENT-RUNNABLE actions — flows (`steps:`) or REST calls (`restAction:`)
# — declared once and run by id from the shell menu (a RuleLink's RunAction) or any page button.
# Ids are global; a page's or shell's own action of the same id wins. Server logic stays an
# @Action method. See https://mateu.io/java-ui-definition/action-catalogue/
type: Actions
actions: []
